t, fetching first when needed."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"QueryObserverResult.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryObserverResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":">>"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"destroy","text":"destroy","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"refetch","text":"refetch","level":3},{"id":"suspense","text":"suspense","level":3},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype QueryResultAccessor<TData, TError> = ValueAccessor<QueryObserverResult<TData, TError>> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/createQueryController.ts:38](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/createQueryController.ts#L38)\n\nAccessor returned by `createQueryController`.\n\nCall the accessor or read its `current` property to get the latest query\nresult. The attached methods delegate to the active query observer.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### destroy\n\n```ts\ndestroy: () => void;\n```\n\nRemoves the controller from its Lit host and unsubscribes observers.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n### refetch\n\n```ts\nrefetch: QueryObserverResult<TData, TError>[\"refetch\"];\n```\n\nRefetches the current query.\n\n### suspense\n\n```ts\nsuspense: () => Promise<QueryObserverResult<TData, TError>>;\n```\n\nResolves with an optimistic query result, fetching first when needed.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`QueryObserverResult`](QueryObserverResult.md)\\<`TData`, `TError`\\>\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: QueryResultAccessor\ntitle: QueryResultAccessor\n---\n\n```ts\ntype QueryResultAccessor<TData, TError> = ValueAccessor<QueryObserverResult<TData, TError>> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/createQueryController.ts:38](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/createQueryController.ts#L38)\n\nAccessor returned by `createQueryController`.\n\nCall the accessor or read its `current` property to get the latest query\nresult. The attached methods delegate to the active query observer.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### destroy\n\n```ts\ndestroy: () => void;\n```\n\nRemoves the controller from its Lit host and unsubscribes observers.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n### refetch\n\n```ts\nrefetch: QueryObserverResult<TData, TError>[\"refetch\"];\n```\n\nRefetches the current query.\n\n### suspense\n\n```ts\nsuspense: () => Promise<QueryObserverResult<TData, TError>>;\n```\n\nResolves with an optimistic query result, fetching first when needed.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`QueryObserverResult`](QueryObserverResult.md)\\<`TData`, `TError`\\>\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError`\n"}
